---
<style>
  .about-text {
    width: 100%;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .about-text__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-48) var(--space-24) var(--space-64);
  }

  .about-text__rule {
    width: min(12rem, 40%);
    height: 1px;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-40);
    background: var(--color-border-soft);
    border: 0;
  }

  .about-text__note {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-24);
    padding: 14px 18px 16px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-text-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sello);
    transform: rotate(-1.2deg);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about-text__recado {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .about-text__note-meta {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .about-text__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .about-text__copy {
    margin: var(--space-24) auto 0;
    max-width: 48ch;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .about-text__row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    margin-top: var(--space-32);
  }

  .about-text__stamp {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .about-text__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .about-text__link:hover,
  .about-text__link:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .about-text__inner {
      padding: var(--space-64) var(--space-40);
    }

    .about-text__recado {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .about-text__note {
      animation: about-settle 0.8s var(--ease-out) both;
    }
  }

  @keyframes about-settle {
    from {
      transform: rotate(-1.2deg) translateY(10px);
    }
    to {
      transform: rotate(-1.2deg) translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="about-text" id="sobre-mi" aria-labelledby="about-text-heading">
  <div class="about-text__inner">
    <hr class="about-text__rule" aria-hidden="true" />
    <aside class="about-text__note" aria-label="Recado">
      <p class="about-text__recado">Que el desarrollo pueda comunicar</p>
      <span class="about-text__note-meta"></span>
    </aside>
    <h2 id="about-text-heading" class="about-text__title">Sobre mí</h2>
    <p class="about-text__copy">
      Me formé en comunicación y trabajo en desarrollo web. Django, Wagtail, Astro y n8n, para que el sitio se entienda y quien lo herede sepa qué hacer con él.
    </p>
    <div class="about-text__row">
      <span class="about-text__stamp">Comunicación + Django</span>
      <a class="about-text__link" href="/#proyectos">Ver proyectos ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
